 ploads/event/Mobilize%20Graphics%284%29_20260701191334837717.png
DESCRIPTION:Phone banking and text banking with the ACLU empowers voluntee
 rs to contact voters to mobilize support for key civil rights and educate 
 citizens about their voting rights. ACLU of Indiana phone banks are conduc
 ted remotely. You only need a phone\, computer\, and internet access to pa
 rticipate from the comfort of your home. You will use provided scripts to 
 help voters register\, inform them of what’s on their ballot or encourag
 e them to turn out to the polls. No prior experience is necessary. Sessio
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/acluin/event/981206/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Central Indiana (Mobilize)
